\\/\",\"blank\":\"1\"}',3,0,'main','2019-07-11 09:22:54'),(71,'Shiva 2x1','Masajes 2x1','En el corazón de Palermo 2x1 en Masaje para compartir con Amigas o Pareja.','{\"photoname\":\"banner-shiva2x1-7462\",\"extension\":\"png\",\"position\":\"50% 50%\"}','{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.estilospa.com\\/promo\\/shiva-masajes\\/1120-2x1-circuito-masajes-de-tejido-profundo-\",\"blank\":\"1\"}',2,1,'main','2019-07-25 11:40:47'),(72,'Spa','','','{\"photoname\":\"banner-web-agosto-2019-9972\",\"extension\":\"png\",\"position\":\"50% 50%\"}','{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.estilospa.com\\/busqueda\\/\",\"blank\":\"1\"}',1,1,'main','2019-08-02 09:43:12');
