li>\n	<li>Belleza de pies y manos&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Hidrataci&oacute;n capilar&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Camilla termomasajeadora con piedras de jade&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Reflexologia podal vibratoria&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\n<strong>Duraci&oacute;n apoximada 6 hs (El voucher una vez comprado tiene 3 meses de validez) &nbsp;</strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong><strong><strong><strong>-----------------------------------------------------------</strong></strong></strong></strong><br />\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\n<strong>Promo 8: Day Spa Hombre:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n	<li>Circuito de Hidroterapia&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Masajes descontracturantes&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Antioxidantes con vinoterapia&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Masajes energizantes con piedras calientes&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Camilla termomasajeadora con piedras de jade&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Reflexologia podal vibratoria&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\n<strong>Duraci&oacute;n apoximada entre 4 y 5 hs (El voucher una vez comprado tiene 3 meses de validez)</strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong><strong><strong><strong>-----------------------------------------------------------</strong></strong></strong></strong><br />\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\n<strong>Promo 9: Day Spa Hol&iacute;stico:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n	<li>Circuito de Hidroterapia&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Reiki Bioactivo&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Masajes energizantes con piedras calientes&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Extracto de palta antioxidante&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Reflexolog&iacute;a manual&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;&nbsp